Data_Dir : ../data/


Audio:

Volume : 1.0
New Game : sounds/new_game.wav
Pause/Continue Game : sounds/pause_game.wav
Apple Hit : sounds/apple_hit.wav
Lemon Hit : sounds/lemon_hit.wav
Special Apple Hit : sounds/special_apple_hit.wav
Special Lemon Hit : sounds/special_lemon_hit.wav
Special Hit : sounds/special_hit.wav


Textures:

Player : textures/basket.png
Apple : textures/apple.png
Lemon : textures/lemon.png
Leaf : textures/leaf.png
Special : textures/special.png


Controls:

Move Player Left : Left
Move Player Right : Right
Open Game Settings : Control + S
New Game : Control + N
Pause/Continue Game : Control + P
Quit Game : Control + Q
About Game : Control + A
